 Conclusion: 
 The Managed with Unmanaged Save approach in SAP RAP combines automated transactional and CRUD handling with custom database save logic. This hybrid pattern allows developers to modernize applications by reusing legacy BAPIs and Function Modules within the save_modified phase.

